That's _very_ far fetched, isn't it? Mummification is much more than
wrapping some fabric around a corpse. That's only the looks, it doesn't
explain the undead-ness.

> But any real life explanation of such design issues is hard anyway.
> For the sake of atmosphere I like Nethacks way of "resurrection" as
> zombies and mummies, etc. in bones files.

